able=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>\u2212</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-492bdc1f56938074624944b41dce71df\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/492bdc1f56938074624944b41dce71df\"></div> \n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"94\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
